WEBVTT

00:00:00.352 --> 00:00:11.312
The desktop sidebar shows the current workspace above Inbox. If its name is too long for the row, it ends with an ellipsis. The status and settings cog sit underneath.

00:00:12.265 --> 00:00:22.785
Click the workspace name to see the other workspaces and the option to add one. Select the build studio and its name stays on one line, with the remote label and cog underneath.

00:00:23.739 --> 00:00:31.779
The cog opens settings for the workspace on display. The sidebar gives direct access to switching workspaces and editing the current one.
